I pull out my device and dial Daren first. I give him a quick, stripped-down summary—leaving out the machinery beneath the seredium tower—and assure him we made it back in one piece. He's been trying to reach us for over an hour. Once he agrees to meet us outside the infirmary, I dial Hadrik and repeat the brief account. He promises to meet us in ten minutes and cuts the connection.

